{"id":"versagen","lemma":"Versagen","pos":"noun","rank":1888,"glosses":["failure"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/65/De-Versagen.ogg/De-Versagen.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Versagens"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich werde nicht versagen.","en":"I won't fail.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/85639","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Wir werden nicht versagen.","en":"We will not fail.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to become"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Hast du Angst zu versagen?","en":"Are you afraid to fail?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"to / too"},null]},{"text":"Sie wird am Ende versagen.","en":"She will fail eventually.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"end, finish"},null]},{"text":"Meine Mutter war von meinem Versagen enttäuscht.","en":"My mother was disappointed by my failure.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"disappointed"}]}]}